 URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n   304→- **Verification**:\n   305→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n   306→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n   307→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n   308→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n   309→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   310→\n   311→**Learnings:**\n   312→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n   313→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n   314→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n   315→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n   316→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n   317→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n   318→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   319→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n   320→\n   321→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   322→- **Sapphire Noir & Champagne Palette**: `--color-sapphire: #1E3A5F`, `--color-sapphire-light: #2A5298`, `--color-sapphire-dark: #0F2440`, `--color-sapphire-deep: #0A1830`, `--color-champagne: #D4AF77`, `--color-champagne-light: #E5C89A`, `--color-champagne-dark: #B8945C`, `--color-ivory: #FAF8F5` - sophisticated, trustworthy premium aesthetic perfect for clinics seeking to convey reliability and elegance\n   323→- **Diamond Border Radius**: `--radius-diamond: 75% 25% 55% 45% / 45% 65% 35% 55%`, `--radius-diamond-2: 55% 45% 35% 65% / 65% 35% 55% 45%`, `--radius-diamond-3: 40% 60% 65% 35% / 55% 45% 35% 65%` for crystalline, geometric shapes with sharp architectural angles\n   324→- **Cinzel Decorative + Manrope Typography**: Roman-inspired decorative serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance with excellent readability\n   325→\n   326→---\n   327→\n   328→## 2025-02-08 - US-055\n   329→- Created complete website for Remon - Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto\n   330→- Files changed:\n   331→  - `site-demo/remon/index.html` (new)\n   332→- **Design Concept**: Sapphire Noir & Champagne aesthetic with deep sapphire blues, warm champagne gold accents on ivory backgrounds. A completely new direction from previous palettes - cool, sophisticated, and trustworthy with crystalline diamond-shaped border-radius patterns creating architectural, geometric animations.\n   333→- **Typography**: Cinzel Decorative (display) paired with Manrope (body) for Roman-inspired elegance with modern geometric readability\n   334→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   335→  - Animated hero with 4 floating diamond-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   336→  - Diamond border-radius patterns (`--radius-diamond`, `--radius-diamond-2`, `--radius-diamond-3`) create crystalline, architectural shapes\n   337→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   338→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n   339→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   340→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n   341→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   342→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   343→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   344→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   345→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   346→- **Contact Info**: Sala 715 - Nova Ribeirânia, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14096-730 | (16) 98142-0597\n   347→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/remon\n   348→- **Verification**:\n   349→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n   350→  - Mobile view (375x812) responsive: ✓\n   351→  - Mobile menu hamburger functional: ✓\n   352→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n   353→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n   354→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   355→\n   356→**Learnings:**\n   357→- **Pattern**: Sapphire Noir & Champagne palette creates a cool, sophisticated aesthetic that conveys trust and premium quality - different from all warm palettes used previously (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz, amber/bronze, plum/gold)\n   358→- **Pattern**: Diamond border-radius shapes (`75% 25% 55% 45% / 45% 65% 35% 55%`) provide a more geometric, crystalline interpretation of blobmorphism with sharp architectural angles that differentiate from organic petal/flame shapes\n   359→- **Pattern**: Cinzel Decorative + Manrope typography pairing combines Roman-inspired decorative serif elegance with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability that feels classical yet contemporary\n   360→- **Gotcha**: The sapphire-champagne-ivory palette feels more trustworthy and professional while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of reliability, confidence, and excellence\n   361→- **Gotcha**: Diamond-shaped borders create a distinctive crystalline aesthetic with sharp angles that feels architectural and modern - completely different from the soft organic curves of previous sites\n   362→- **Gotcha**: Ivory backgrounds (#FAF8F5) provide warmth without being as yellow-based as champagne tones, creating a cleaner, more modern foundation that pairs beautifully with cool sapphire tones\n   363→- **Gotcha**: The cool sapphire palette differentiates significantly from the warm feminine palettes of previous sites while maintaining the premium aesthetic expected by aesthetic clinic clients\n   364→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   365→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n   366→- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n   367→- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n   368→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n   369→\n   370→---\n   371→\n   372→## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n   373→- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   374→- Files changed:\n   375→  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n   376→- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n   377→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n   378→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   379→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   380→  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n   381→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   382→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n   383→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   384→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n   385→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   386→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   387→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   388→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   389→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   390→- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n   391→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n   392→- **Verification**:\n   393→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n   394→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n   395→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n   396→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n   397→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   398→\n   399→**Learnings:**\n   400→- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n   401→- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n   402→- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n   403→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n   404→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n   405→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n   406→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   407→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n   408→\n   409→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   410→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n   411→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n   412→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n   413→- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n   414→- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n   415→\n   416→---\n   417→\n   418→## 2025-02-08 - US-050\n   419→- Created complete website for Dra. Amanda Gaipo - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   420→- Files changed:\n   421→  - `site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo/index.html` (new)\n   422→- **Design Concept**: Twilight Lavender & Mocha aesthetic with warm lavender, soft mocha, and champagne accents. Contemporary and fashion-forward while maintaining premium elegance. Triple organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n   423→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Lato (body) for sophisticated, modern readability\n   424→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   425→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   426→  - Triple organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob anima