{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090307278af1c82b262540ec","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me design the unique aesthetic direction and create the complete HTML file. Based on the patterns learned, I'll create a completely new palette for Dra. Isabelle Marchi - Rinomodelação Estruturada.\n\n**Design Direction for Dra. Isabelle Marchi - Rinomodelação Estruturada:**\n\nFor a rinomodelação specialist, I'll create a **Platinum Noir & Rose Gold** aesthetic with:\n- Cool platinum silver tones with rose gold metallic accents\n- Sophisticated, medical-elegance feel\n- Structural geometric shapes that reference nasal architecture\n- Typography: Libre Baskerville (display) + Manrope (body) for sophisticated elegance"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c28b0a14-6f5e-46c7-a152-5f0926e9e561","uuid":"59ad4da0-97b8-4436-ad75-1f32e4409755"}
